      "title": "queue records shutdown errors as failures, unlike postWindowBounds",
      "message": "When PostWindow fails because the app or window is already closed, queue stores the error as a pending failure. postWindowBounds filters exactly these errors. A drop, float or ready callback that races with window close or shutdown therefore reports a spurious failure through the driver's central error path.",
